# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore for this build; the context is the
# repo root, so everything the Rust API image doesn't need is excluded here.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.github
.claude
.design
.design-sync
graphify-out
docs
infra
apps/api-rust/target
apps/api-rust/uploads
apps/api-rust/tests
# apps/api: only the migrations are needed.
apps/api/*
!apps/api/drizzle
apps/cli
apps/extension
apps/mobile
apps/web
packages
